       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-32-UNSTRING-TALLYING.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SRC PIC X(10) VALUE "A,B,C     ".
01 A PIC X(2).
01 B PIC X(2).
01 C PIC X(2).
01 N PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
UNSTRING SRC DELIMITED BY "," INTO A B C TALLYING IN N
DISPLAY A
DISPLAY B
DISPLAY C
DISPLAY N
STOP RUN.
